omx-plugins (0.19.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * release: omx-plugins 0.19.3
  * ci: the contract package's file list names plugin-face.json and
    role-meanings.json
  * Build floor: omx-panel 0.13.2, the release whose modgui-test counts a
    meter frame
  * recipe-selftest: a swap named in shippedDiff is a new contract version
  * host-contract: the faces held to the contract are the shipped ones
  * omx-new-plugin: a new plugin's first contract fingerprint is written by
    the wizard
  * panel-check: a display's floor is read as the face serves it; the probe
    arms name the checker's own lines
  * modgui: the generated MOD GUI files are omx-panel 0.13.1's
  * host-contract: libomx-clap-core trusts every built face's contract
  * param-contract: the canonical serialisation names each row by its CLAP id
  * contract-dir: the definition files this package owns must be in contract/
    and installed
  * plugin-face: OMX_PLUGIN_FACE_IDS is ours, contract/plugin-face.json, with
    the header rendered here
  * meter-binding: every meter a shipped plugin exports is drawn by a
    display, or listed unbound with its reason
  * omx-comp draws its transfer curve and its gain-reduction bar; panels from
    omx-panel 0.13
  * param-contract: a ratio travel's unit is ratio, as the LV2 face writes
    it; each plugin's contract version from its own history
  * contract: the meaning each role of our panels plays, installed into
    omx-contract's contract directory
  * release: build the DEBs beside the RPMs

 -- Pau Aliagas <linuxnow@gmail.com>  Wed, 11 Nov 2026 16:41:23 +0000
